      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko bahur bakhaano ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਨੂੰ ਬਖਾਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 762,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को बहुरि बखानो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108050",
      "sourceShabadId": "9538",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0762_line_0041",
      "lineIndex": 41,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਸਭ ਜੀਅ ਜਾਨੋ ॥੮੩੧॥",
      "transliteration": "naam tupak ke sabh jeea jaano ||831||",
      "translation": "Add the words “Jaachar-pati-shatru” after firstly uttering the word “Saritendrani” and know the names of Tupak in your mind.831.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਭ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੮੩੧॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 762,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नाम तुपक के सभ जीअ जानो ॥८३१॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108051",
      "sourceShabadId": "9538",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0762_line_0042",
      "lineIndex": 42,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦੋਹਰਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dhoharaa ||",
      "translation": "DOHRA",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਦੋਹਰਾ:",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 762,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दोहरा ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108052",
      "sourceShabadId": "9539",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0762_line_0043",
      "lineIndex": 43,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਰਿਤਾ ਨ੍ਰਿਪਨਿਨਿ ਬਕਤ੍ਰ ਤੇ ਪ੍ਰਥਮੈ ਕਰੋ ਉਚਾਰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "saritaa nirapanin bakatr te prathamai karo uchaar ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਸਰਿਤਾ ਨ੍ਰਿਪਨਿਨਿ' (ਗੰਗਾ ਨਦੀ ਵਾਲੀ ਧਰਤੀ) (ਸ਼ਬਦ) ਮੂੰਹ ਤੋਂ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 762,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सरिता नृपनिनि बकत्र ते प्रथमै करो उचार ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108053",
      "sourceShabadId": "9539",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0762_line_0044",
      "lineIndex": 44,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਪਤਿ ਕਹਿ ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਜੀਅ ਧਾਰ ॥੮੩੨॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char pat keh satr keh naam tupak jeea dhaar ||832||",
      "translation": "Utter firstly the word “Saritaanrapnin” from your mouth and then saying the words “Jaachar-pati-shatru”, know the names of Tupak in your mind.832.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਪਤਿ (ਸ਼ਬਦ) ਕਹ ਕੇ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹੋ। (ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੮੩੨॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 762,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर पति कहि सत्रु कहि नाम तुपक जीअ धार ॥८३२॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108054",
      "sourceShabadId": "9539",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0762_line_0045",
      "lineIndex": 45,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅੜਿਲ ॥",
      "transliteration": "aRil ||",
      "translation": "ARIL",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅੜਿਲ:",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 762,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अड़िल ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108055",
      "sourceShabadId": "9540",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0762_line_0046",
      "lineIndex": 46,
      "gurmukhi": "ਆਦਿ ਤਰੰਗਨਿ ਰਾਜਨਿ ਸਬਦ ਉਚਾਰੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "aadh tara(n)gan raajan sabadh uchaareeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਤਰੰਗਨਿ ਰਾਜਨਿ' (ਗੰਗਾ ਵਾਲੀ ਧਰਤੀ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਨੂੰ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 762,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "आदि तरंगनि राजनि सबद उचारीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108056",
      "sourceShabadId": "9540",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0762_line_0047",
      "lineIndex": 47,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਪੁਨਿ ਦੇ ਡਾਰੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh naik padh pun dhe ddaareeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਜਾ ਚਰ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ 'ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜ ਲਵੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 762,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि नाइक पद पुनि दे डारीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108057",
      "sourceShabadId": "9540",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0762_line_0048",
      "lineIndex": 48,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਤਾ ਕੇ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨੀਐ ॥",
